OL,3,GNEWSAWhy more families are choosing    
OL,4,Ahome education                         
OL,6,FAimee believes removing her            
OL,7,Fnine-year-old son from school has      
OL,8,Fhelped him get "the sparkle back in his
OL,9,Feyes".                                 
OL,11,FGeorge is non-verbal with profound and 
OL,12,Fmultiple learning disabilities and     
OL,13,Fwhile he attended a specialist school  
OL,14,Fin Hull, Aimee felt his needs were not 
OL,15,Fbeing met.                             
OL,17,FIn January, George became one of more  
OL,18,Fthan 1,000 children being educated at  
OL,19,Fhome in the city, according to a       
OL,20,Fcouncil report ` a figure that has     
OL,21,Fgrown from 380 in 2022.                
